  "details": "1. Pull out the camera\n\n2. Enable \"Audio follows camera\" in the dolly options\n\n3. Set up a dolly path\n\n4. Enable camera flying\n\n5. Start the dolly path\n\n6. Move the stick like you are controlling the flying camera\n\nAudio follows the invisible flying camera, but camera video and the remote lens follows the dolly path.",
